<title>SOUTH AFRICA: QUICKO CAUTIONS IT IN TALKS.</title>
<headline>QUICKO CAUTIONS IT IN TALKS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quicko Holdings Ltd said on Friday it had entered into negotiations, which if successfully concluded could have an effect on the firm's share price.</p>
<p>Shareholders were accordingly advised to exercise caution in their sharedealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
